From 943b6ed0ddb8463fc7af8f0e678170d478829ce9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Witold=20Gre=C5=84?= <witold.gren@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:54:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] WebSocket control API (ws, ws-rtsp) and optional PIR XML
 fields

- new [websocket] config and ws / ws-rtsp commands: GET /ws (hello, commands,
  state events), GET /snapshot/{camera} (JPEG, ?max_age cache), GET /healthz,
  optional bearer token; background reads are passive so idle battery
  cameras are never woken
- RfAlarmCfg: rfID, sensitivity, timeBlockList and alarmHandle are optional;
  Reolink Go Plus omits them and the parse error dropped the connection

Tested with Reolink Go Plus (G330) over 4G relay.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
